  "description": "On Christmas Eve, bell boy Eunchan meets his favorite actor Jae, in the hotel he's working for. Jae wants to practice his script with his manager but his manager ditched him for a holiday vacation. Desperate to have a script reading partner, he enlists the help of Eunchan. Something interesting happens after their script reading...\n\n***Note:**  \nPart of Penis Navida: [Hotel XMAS](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series.html?id=3350491531) 2020 event by Bomtoon, this is Story 7 (Ch.23-25) on Lezhin*",
